  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Humanitarian Response Programme  2022-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide lifesaving assistance to people in Mozambique affected by conflict and by climate disasters.  MHRP is based on evidence of need and gaps across the humanitarian sector.  It will reach 350,000 people with interventions in food security, nutrition, and protection.  Additionally, MHRP will reach 100,000 people each year with prepositioning of emergency stocks to respond to climatic events.</narrative>
  </description>
